{"id":"73d62bd90536b18f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/870_Noncommutative_Linear_Logic.md","title":"870 Noncommutative Linear Logic","display":"870_Noncommutative_Linear_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"870-Noncommutative-Linear-Logic\">870 Noncommutative Linear Logic</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为原子集合。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{unit},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{unit},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为这些构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cdot B,A\\backslash B,B/A\">\\(A\\cdot B,A\\backslash B,B/A\\)</span> 分别表示乘积、左除、右除。NCLL 在后文使用有序列表上下文，并令交换关系取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由原子与替换\">3. 自由原子与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{unit})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{unit})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{unit}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{unit},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{unit}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{unit},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{NCLL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{NCLL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-有序上下文与序列\">4. 有序上下文与序列</h1>\n<p>定义有限有序列表及空列：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{List}=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^m,\\qquad\\epsilon=().\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{List}=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^m,\\qquad\\epsilon=().\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:m\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\Gamma:m\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta:n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\Delta:n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，连接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta:m+n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta:m+n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta)(i)=\\begin{cases}\\Gamma(i)&amp;i&lt;m,\\\\\\Delta(i-m)&amp;m\\le i&lt;m+n.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta)(i)=\\begin{cases}\\Gamma(i)&amp;i&lt;m,\\\\\\Delta(i-m)&amp;m\\le i&lt;m+n.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>列表相等为长度相同且对应项相等，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A)\">\\((A)\\)</span> 是长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的列表。逗号表示同一次序的列表连接。\n定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A,\\Delta=\\Gamma\\cdot(A)\\cdot\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta=\\Gamma\\cdot(A)\\cdot\\Delta\\)</span>。序列为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理\">5. 公理</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}=\\{A\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\\cup\\{\\epsilon\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{unit}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}=\\{A\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\\cup\\{\\epsilon\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{unit}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-规则关系\">6. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下每个规则族均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 的子集。</p>\n<p>约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1}),Q)\">\\((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1}),Q)\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(();Q):=((),Q)\">\\((();Q):=((),Q)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}=\\{((\\Gamma,A,B,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C);\\Gamma,\\operatorname{prod}(A,B),\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}=\\{((\\Gamma,A,B,\\Delta\\Rightarrow C);\\Gamma,\\operatorname{prod}(A,B),\\Delta\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}=\\{((A,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}=\\{((A,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C);\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B),\\Pi\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C);\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B),\\Pi\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}=\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}=\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C);\\Delta,\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A),\\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,B,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C);\\Delta,\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A),\\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow C):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,A,\\Pi\\Rightarrow B);\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow B):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta,A,\\Pi\\Rightarrow B);\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow B):\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明树\">7. 证明树</h1>\n<p>有限有根有序树是四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 无父节点，其余节点有唯一父节点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 无环且每个节点沿父关系有限步到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(u)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\)</span> 无重复地有限列举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的全部直接子节点。</p>\n<p>明确关系及枚举的型别和方向：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\ \\subseteq T\\times T,\\qquad\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\prec\\ \\subseteq T\\times T,\\qquad\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\prec u\">\\(v\\prec u\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接子节点，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 是其父节点。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in T\">\\(u\\in T\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_u=|\\operatorname{ch}(u)|\">\\(n_u=|\\operatorname{ch}(u)|\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ch}(u))=\\{v\\in T:v\\prec u\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ch}(u))=\\{v\\in T:v\\prec u\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i,j&lt;n_u\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{ch}(u)(i)=\\operatorname{ch}(u)(j)\\Longrightarrow i=j\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i,j&lt;n_u\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{ch}(u)(i)=\\operatorname{ch}(u)(j)\\Longrightarrow i=j\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明树是五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span> 是上述树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span>，并且每个节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in T\">\\(u\\in T\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 没有直接子节点且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\">\\(\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(u)=(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(u)=(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})\\)</span>，并且</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对集合参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,Q\">\\(\\pi,Q\\)</span> 定义证明检查谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\pi,Q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\n\\exists T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell\\;\n\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi=(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\land\n(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\text{ 满足本节的全部有限有根有序树条件}\\\\\n{}\\land\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\\ell(r)=Q\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\left((\\operatorname{ch}(u)=()\\land\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}})\n\\lor(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\ne()\\land(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u),\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}})\\right)\n\\end{array}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\pi,Q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\n\\exists T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell\\;\n\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi=(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\land\n(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\text{ 满足本节的全部有限有根有序树条件}\\\\\n{}\\land\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\\ell(r)=Q\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\left((\\operatorname{ch}(u)=()\\land\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}})\n\\lor(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\ne()\\land(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u),\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}})\\right)\n\\end{array}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u)\">\\(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\)</span> 为有序子标号列。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 定义证明纤维类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\pi,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\pi,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本节及下节的证明纤维按参数展开为可定义类，成员断言缩写右侧谓词；不声明所有任意节点重标号的全体为集合，不对该类取幂集。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导性\">8. 可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\pi,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\pi,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 定义证明类与证书类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(Q)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\pi,Q)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(Q)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\pi,Q)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\pi,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A)\\}\n=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\pi,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A)\\}\n=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些类只索引当地有限证明树，不引入语义载体或外延满足关系。</p>\n<p>NCLL 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{List},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{List},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>以下是元层规格包；证明纤维按本地谓词模式展开，不是将真类作为集合元素的元组。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{List},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{List},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ex}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{NCLL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义非交换有序线性证明关系；不含交换、收缩、弱化或语义解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"870-Noncommutative-Linear-Logic","text":"870 Noncommutative Linear Logic","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由原子与替换","text":"3. 自由原子与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-有序上下文与序列","text":"4. 有序上下文与序列","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理","text":"5. 公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-规则关系","text":"6. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明树","text":"7. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导性","text":"8. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{unit},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\cdot B,A\\backslash B,B/A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{unit})=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\o